{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","title":"lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3603,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-immersion-metric]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-metric]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","line":6186,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[A Riemannian Submanifold is a Pseudo-Riemannian Submanifold]\n\\label{lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map, lem:pullback-immersion-metric, def:induced-metric}\n\n\n\n\nFor a smooth immersion $F:M\\to\\bar M$ into a Riemannian manifold, the induced metric of Definition \\ref{def:induced-metric} is induced along $F$ in the sense of Definition \\ref{def:induced-tensor-along-map}.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map,lem:pullback-immersion-metric,def:induced-metric}\n\\sketch Lemma \\ref{lem:pullback-immersion-metric} gives positive definiteness, and the pullback formula is exactly Definition \\ref{def:induced-tensor-along-map}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[A Riemannian Submanifold is a Pseudo-Riemannian Submanifold] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d7375626d616e69666f6c642d696e64756365642d74656e736f72\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-immersion-metric\">↗ lem:pullback-immersion-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-metric\">↗ def:induced-metric</a> <p></p>For a smooth immersion <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F:M\\to \\bar M$\">$F:M\\to \\bar M$</span> into a Riemannian manifold, the induced metric of Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-metric\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-metric\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a696e64756365642d6d6574726963\">5</a> is induced along <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F$\">$F$</span> in the sense of Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a696e64756365642d74656e736f722d616c6f6e672d6d6170\">17</a>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-immersion-metric\">↗ lem:pullback-immersion-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-metric\">↗ def:induced-metric</a> \\sketch Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apullback-immersion-metric\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-immersion-metric\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70756c6c6261636b2d696d6d657273696f6e2d6d6574726963\">5</a> gives positive definiteness, and the pullback formula is exactly Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a696e64756365642d74656e736f722d616c6f6e672d6d6170\">17</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:bilinear-comp-of-family","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","label":"def:induced-tensor-along-map"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-immersion-metric","title":"lem:pullback-immersion-metric","label":"lem:pullback-immersion-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-metric","title":"def:induced-metric","label":"def:induced-metric"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","title":"lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[A Riemannian Submanifold is a Pseudo-Riemannian Submanifold]\n\\label{lem:riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map, lem:pullback-immersion-metric, def:induced-metric}\n\n\n\n\nFor a smooth immersion $F:M\\to\\bar M$ into a Riemannian manifold, the induced metric of Definition \\ref{def:induced-metric} is induced along $F$ in the sense of Definition \\ref{def:induced-tensor-along-map}.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-tensor-along-map,lem:pullback-immersion-metric,def:induced-metric}\n\\sketch Lemma \\ref{lem:pullback-immersion-metric} gives positive definiteness, and the pullback formula is exactly Definition \\ref{def:induced-tensor-along-map}.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pullback-immersion-metric","title":"lem:pullback-immersion-metric","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-metric","title":"def:induced-metric","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}